    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "WN\nMOLTON BROW\nfreshmint\ntoothpaste\ndentifrice\nADEN\nHair \u0026 Body\nport Wash\nOLTON BROT\nLONDON\n30ml/Tho2\nMOLTON BROWN\ntravel wellbeing\nSit back and enjoy this luxurious Molton Brown\nwellbeing companion, put together exclusively for your\nüse in light. Each of the products inside has been\nhandmade in the Uk using rich aromatic oils pure\nnatural essences and the finest technology available.\nThe combination features our unique high performance\ntravel formulations to ensure you feel good while\non-board and during your onward journey.\nSo relax and take the time to pamper your senses\nand your body while you fly...\nfreshmint toothpaste 7ml\nAwaken your senses! Give teeth, gums and mouth that deep\nclean feeling before landing by brushing with this zingy.\nfluoride-free formula. It's a great way to freshen up after\na snooze, eating and before you land.\nherbal freshmint mouthwash 30ml\nA fine blend of mint extracts and natural marshmallow combine\nin this deep cleansing, anti-bacterial oral rinse: the ultimate\nin-flight refresher.\nHCREDIENTS PUSIRED WATER SADDAY, POLY\nALTREA DEFIINALISS AROMA, SOE\nKBATE 20, MASHMA LOM CHIRA\n2 РОМО 2 НІТрИСЯ У 9 кро. С0.42052 С10912\ntravel companion lip balm 5g\nPrevent in-flight dehydration with this moisturising, all-weather\nlip salve. Vitamins, coconut, aloe vera and honey help you to\nkeep smooth, kissable, and stop damage from the sun and wind.\nVERAL COCOS MICTUMD, HA, PROPYL GALLATE, CHRIC ACID. BUTYLPARABEN\ncoco de mer face \u0026 body lotion 30ml\nBydrate your hands and body with this Rawless blend of pun\nmer and honey. The Iuxurous. ultra light formula\ninstantly melts into the skin leaving it wrapped in a sell\nprotechive mosture cocoon\nBRITISH AIRWAYS"
